abstract: "Research software and reproducibility materials for a construction-feasibility study of rotor-scheduled Hill-derived 8 x 8 binary matrices as a reversible, locally diffusion-bounded linear layer in an experimental substitution-permutation network. HESPN is a research harness, not a deployment-ready cipher or a claimed replacement for a standardized primitive."
keywords:
